          "text": "The last month of class will be dedicated to a group project. This will be a project of your own devising, built from the ground up (libraries/apis are allowed). There are required components such as having both an api server+database and a clientside that you have to build through a series of milestones. Best practices, group dynamics, agile, etc will all be on the menu.",
          "styles": {}
